	(text "RR-CHS-MAIN  -  Chassis main board"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 25 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 5 5)
				(thickness 1)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "1900bf06-533d-5f3b-8f33-1c7ee1339f79")
	)
	(text "Revision A    Date 2026-11-26    Doc No RR-EL-0100\n\nChassis main board: pack entry and switch, LiFePO4 charger and power path, 5.12 V / 3.3 V / 5 V rails,\neFuse branches (head power, head heater, chassis heater, LiDAR, bus 5 V), hardwired traction safety chain\nwith latch relay, VMOT eFuse, two DRV8874 H-bridges with DPDT brake relays, STM32G474 motion MCU with IMU,\nexpanders, 11 ToF branches, USB/RS-485 head link and panel drivers.\nNetlist: design/circuit.py (stage 1) + overrides.py (stage 2 deviations S2-xx, see STAGE2_CHANGE_REQUESTS.md).\nNOT A SAFETY-RATED CIRCUIT.\n\nLayers: 6    Thickness: 1.60 mm\nRails: 3V3, 3V3A, GND, V12_AUX, V5_AUX, V5_BUCK, V5_CM5, VBAT_SW, VMOT, VREF_3V0, VSYS\nNet class SAFETY_CHAIN: track 0.40 mm, clearance 0.50 mm, via 0.80/0.40 mm  [CH_N*, CHAIN_END, RUN_12V, RUN_HD, RELAY_RTN, COIL_RTN, K1_*, SET_CAP, SET_DIS, RSET_A, K?_CL, HANDS_LAMP_*]\nNet class HC_PACK: track 1.00 mm, clearance 0.15 mm, via 0.80/0.40 mm  [VBAT_RAW, PSW_SRC, VBAT_PROT, VBAT_SW]\nNet class HC_VMOT: track 0.80 mm, clearance 0.15 mm, via 0.80/0.40 mm  [VMOT, OUT1_L, OUT2_L, OUT1_R, OUT2_R, MOT_L_A, MOT_L_B, MOT_R_A, MOT_R_B, MOTC_*, BRK_*, CLAMP_F, CLAMP_R]\nNet class HC_BRANCH: track 0.80 mm, clearance 0.15 mm, via 0.80/0.40 mm  [HEAD_HTR_F, HEAD_HTR_P, HEAD_HTR_N, CHS_HTR_F, CHS_HTR_P, V5_BUCK, V5_CM5, VSYS, CHG_IN, CHG_F, CHG_VIN, U3_CLP, U3_CSP, U3_SW, U10_SW]\nNet class PWR_1A5: track 0.40 mm, clearance 0.15 mm, via 0.60/0.30 mm  [HEAD_PWR_F, HEAD_PWR_E, HEAD_PWR_P, V12_LIDAR, 3V3, V5_AUX, 3V3A, V12_AUX, BUS_5V, TOF*_3V3, ENC_*_5V, U11_SW, U12_SW]\nNet class SIG: track 0.20 mm, clearance 0.15 mm, via 0.60/0.30 mm  [*]\n\nThis schematic is generated from board.py by tools/eda (rrkicad).\nAll nets are connected by name (global labels / power symbols); there are no drawn wires between symbols."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 29 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "7598cfcc-fefc-50e0-8f65-111f73b50043")
	)
